#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:10002
#: ee86cee6cc31441f82a587e01fab82f4
msgid "Plotting: Basics"
msgstr "Plotting: 基本"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:10004
#: 57aa402cf05f427fb4b14b3f6a254259
msgid ""
"This notebook introduces the enhanced plotting capabilities of `gwexpy`. We "
"demonstrate the \"nice\" default settings (automatic figsize adjustment, "
"logarithmic axes, layout, axis labels) for matrix data structures such as "
"`TimeSeriesMatrix` and `FrequencySeriesMatrix`, as well as collections like "
"`SpectrogramList`."
msgstr ""
"このノートブックでは、`gwexpy` の強化されたプロット機能を紹介します。 `TimeSeriesMatrix` や "
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix` などの行列データ構造、および `SpectrogramList` "
"などのコレクションに対する、「いい感じ」のデフォルト設定（figsize自動調整、対数軸、レイアウト、軸ラベル）についてデモを行います。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:30002
#: 242bb2be133449b48e7ecda5a62cbb98
msgid "1. TimeSeriesMatrix Plotting"
msgstr "1\\. TimeSeriesMatrix のプロット"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:30004
#: ebf6d0b0ef684f729f8e33b0abe3ffda
msgid ""
"`TimeSeriesMatrix` manages time series data with a 3-dimensional structure "
"(Row, Col, Time). When calling `.plot()`, the following optimizations are "
"applied:"
msgstr ""
"`TimeSeriesMatrix` は (Row, Col, Time) の3次元構造を持つ時系列データを管理します。 `.plot()` "
"を呼び出すと、以下の最適化が行われます："

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:30006
#: eb88dc7bada44fa6b173e4fa188775ca
msgid ""
"**Axis Labels**: \"Time [s]\" or \"Time [s] from ...\" is automatically set "
"by `determine_xlabel`."
msgstr ""
"**軸ラベル**: `determine_xlabel` により \"Time [s]\" や \"Time [s] from ...\" "
"が自動設定されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:30007
#: bb152fba98a74b2dbe2f0b61d771f5a2
msgid ""
"**Auto-GPS**: For time axes, the `auto-gps` scale is applied by default to "
"properly handle GPS time (large offsets)."
msgstr ""
"**Auto-GPS**: 時間軸の場合、デフォルトで `auto-gps` スケールが適用され、GPS時刻（大きなオフセット）が適切に処理されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:30008
#: e9598250396d4fc7bb68e75780cd936f
msgid ""
"**Layout**: The `figsize` is automatically adjusted according to the row and"
" column structure."
msgstr "**レイアウト**: 行・列の構造に合わせて `figsize` が自動調整されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:50002
#: 613d44694aef46599fde2b68a17d98da
msgid "2. FrequencySeriesMatrix Plotting"
msgstr "2\\. FrequencySeriesMatrix のプロット"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:50004
#: bbaf597454554e74a8b2b7c9e5034bd7
msgid ""
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix` manages frequency data with a 3-dimensional "
"structure (Row, Col, Frequency). It typically holds results from spectral "
"analysis. Features of `.plot()`:"
msgstr ""
"`FrequencySeriesMatrix` は (Row, Col, Frequency) の3次元構造を持つ周波数データを管理します。 "
"一般的なスペクトル解析の結果などを保持します。 `.plot()` の特徴："

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:50007
#: 3804cbe384e84588b9dc2e1c90e17bce
msgid ""
"**Logarithmic Axes**: The X-axis (frequency) and Y-axis (amplitude) are "
"automatically set to logarithmic scale depending on conditions such as data "
"size."
msgstr "**対数軸**: データサイズ等の条件に応じて、X軸（周波数）やY軸（振幅）が自動的に対数スケールになります。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:50008
#: f8198f6e891941ca8005eaf797214cf3
msgid "**Axis Labels**: \"Frequency [Hz]\" and \"[unit]\" are automatically set."
msgstr "**軸ラベル**: \"Frequency [Hz]\" や \"[unit]\" が自動設定されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:70002
#: 1199781b93a3480695c13f4a8a465a74
msgid "3. FrequencySeriesList Plotting (Reference)"
msgstr "3\\. FrequencySeriesList Plotting (参考)"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:70004
#: 50d8b0097cb44b0aab40929faa8547e9
msgid ""
"`FrequencySeriesList` (or Dict) is a simple list without a grid structure. "
"It can also be plotted in the same way."
msgstr ""
"`FrequencySeriesList` (または Dict) は、グリッド構造を持たない単純なリストです。 これも同様にプロット可能です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:100002
#: 65ee9f983ade46f7b764dadc463e71b9
msgid "4. SpectrogramList Plotting"
msgstr "4\\. SpectrogramList のプロット"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:100004
#: d3b6a006adfd4e479831a8d9f565a77e
msgid ""
"Plotting of `SpectrogramList` applies a vertical layout with `geometry=(N, "
"1)` by default, along with a logarithmic colorbar. Since spectrograms also "
"have a time axis, the `auto-gps` feature works when GPS time is provided."
msgstr ""
"`SpectrogramList` のプロットは、デフォルトで `geometry=(N, 1)` "
"の縦並びレイアウト、対数カラーバーなどが適用されます。 スペクトログラムも時間軸を持つため、GPS時刻を与えると `auto-gps` が機能します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:120002
#: c1ea77c25c6946d0bf3c1772b9649fba
msgid "5. Adaptive Plotting Optimization (Decimation)"
msgstr "5\\. 適応的プロット最適化（デシメーション）"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:120004
#: 216e333a12ee414197cc0c67687afbaf
msgid ""
"When plotting a `TimeSeries` with a large amount of data, decimation (Min-"
"Max Decimation) is automatically applied to maintain rendering performance."
msgstr ""
"大量のデータを持つ `TimeSeries` をプロットする際、描画パフォーマンスを維持するために自動的に間引き（Min-Max "
"Decimation）を適用します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:120005
#: fa2230714e9b4911be995ca4edb391af
msgid ""
"**Automatic Application**: By default, it is triggered when the number of "
"samples exceeds 50,000."
msgstr "**自動適用**: デフォルトではサンプル数が 50,000 を超える場合に発動します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:120006
#: 059ea2e5e5c04a1784398a12af9f7331
msgid ""
"**Peak Preservation**: The Min-Max algorithm reduces the number of data "
"points (default ~10,000 points) while preserving the waveform envelope "
"(maximum and minimum)."
msgstr ""
"**ピーク維持**: Min-Max アルゴリズムにより、波形のエンベロープ（最大・最小）を保持したままデータ点を削減（デフォルト "
"約10,000点）します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:120007
#: a565e0321dc743bca77a0e19d790962d
msgid ""
"**Customization**: Can be controlled with the `decimate_threshold` and "
"`decimate_points` arguments."
msgstr "**カスタマイズ**: `decimate_threshold` や `decimate_points` 引数で制御可能です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:140002
#: a7c23b6d95884bd49926922c594045f0
msgid "Application to Collections/Matrices and Parameter Specification"
msgstr "コレクション・行列への適用とパラメータ指定"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:140004
#: 573bc2ab24d74a2ea21c4fa8506ebf77
msgid ""
"It also works transparently with `TimeSeriesList` and `TimeSeriesMatrix`. "
"You can also force it to apply by lowering the threshold."
msgstr ""
"`TimeSeriesList` や `TimeSeriesMatrix` でも透過的に機能します。また、閾値を下げて強制的に適用させることも可能です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:160002
#: c2ebc1da654f403f90135e841b901b2b
msgid "6. Spectrogram Summary Plotting"
msgstr "6\\. スペクトログラムのサマリープロット"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:160004
#: 474a47812df84aafab68f8bbb4594448
msgid ""
"`plot_summary` is a feature that vertically arranges multiple `Spectrogram` "
"objects and plots `FrequencySeries` statistics (10%, 50%, 90% percentiles) "
"on the right side of each. This is very useful when checking the time "
"evolution of spectrograms alongside their overall frequency characteristics."
msgstr ""
"`plot_summary` は、複数の `Spectrogram` を垂直に並べ、それぞれの右側に `FrequencySeries` "
"の統計量（10%, 50%, 90% パーセンタイル）をプロットする機能です。 "
"スペクトログラムの時間変化と、その全体的な周波数特性を並べて確認する際に非常に便利です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:160007
#: 1bf7b37bd76640c19b846be64c9d5e54
msgid ""
"**Automatic Synchronization**: The color axis of the spectrogram and the "
"vertical axis of the FrequencySeries are automatically synchronized."
msgstr "**自動同期**: スペクトログラムのカラー軸と FrequencySeries の縦軸が自動的に同期します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:160008
#: 95424b0942d6486fa82fe4844da7dcd0
msgid ""
"**MMM Plot**: Uses `plot_mmm` to display Min/Median/Max (or any percentiles)"
" with shaded areas."
msgstr ""
"**MMMプロット**: `plot_mmm` を用いて、Min/Median/Max（または任意のパーセンタイル）を塗りつぶし付きで表示します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:180002
#: 45cce408d4ef4ec4a0b2e8a3be659913
msgid "7. PairPlot Example"
msgstr "7\\. PairPlot の例"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:180004
#: c53117ebc08241999cd823f6253f1c35
msgid "Below is a basic usage example of `gwexpy.plot.PairPlot`."
msgstr "以下は `gwexpy.plot.PairPlot` の基本的な使用例です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:180005
#: 7e550521a62549438b5500f52fdcc1ee
msgid "Create two `TimeSeries` with different sampling rates"
msgstr "2 つの `TimeSeries` を同じ長さ・サンプリングレート・時間範囲で作成"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:180006
#: 6326c03fc3ca4a5daa473f7553b23f35
msgid ""
"`PairPlot` requires the input series to already have the same length, sample"
" rate, and time span; align them explicitly with `resample()` and `crop()` "
"before plotting if needed"
msgstr "入力が異なる場合は、事前に `resample()` と `crop()` で明示的に揃えてから `PairPlot` に渡します"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:180007
#: 1fcdb0a326f14ee5bbdb5c82fd0508b1
msgid "With `corner=True` (default), only the lower-left triangle is drawn"
msgstr "`corner=True`（デフォルト）により左下三角だけが描画されます"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/tutorials/intro_plotting.ipynb:180009
#: b8bcd13c633a4d2a9910faf596c9d6d3
msgid ""
"When executed, histograms appear on the diagonal and 2D histograms on the "
"off-diagonal."
msgstr "実行すると、対角にヒストグラム、非対角に 2D ヒストグラムが表示されます。"
